<Base title="Disclaimer · geoprims" description="What geoprims results are for and what they are not: planning, engineering, and education aids, not certified navigation, flight, or legal survey tools." canonical="/disclaimer/">
  <PageHeader title="Disclaimer" purpose={`geoprims tools are planning, engineering, and education aids.`} />
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Not for primary navigation.</strong> No geoprims tool is certified for navigation or flight operations. Aviation and drone results do not replace your aircraft's POH/AFM, official charts and publications, a flight briefing, or current regulations.</li>
    <li><strong>Not a legal survey.</strong> Survey tools are not legal survey determinations. Boundary and title questions need a licensed surveyor.</li>
    <li><strong>Check operational values.</strong> Verify anything you act on against official sources. Each tool shows its model, accuracy, sources, and assumptions under "How we got this", and warnings name the assumptions a result depends on.</li>
    <li><strong>Review status.</strong> Tools are marked experimental until they pass the <a href="/methodology/">verification bar</a>. Practitioner review status is shown on each domain page.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>If a result looks wrong, use "Report a problem" on the tool, or see the <a href="/known-issues/">known issues</a>.</p>
</Base>
